    ">
      <p style="
        font-size: var(--font-size-body);
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        line-height: 1.5;
        margin-bottom: 2em;
        margin-top: 0px;
        word-spacing: 0.16em
      ">
        You can now use the Vault to store items like this securely.
      </p>
